<div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-4">
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white"><%= brandText %></span>
<p class="opacity-90">© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= brandText %> - <%= footerOrgLine %>. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
</div>
